Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790492399999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790467199999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The trend's middle is a 20-bar overlapping range (2357.18-2557.46, 1787356800000-1788998399999), so much of the post-spike structure is two-sided rather than a tight channel.", "1789084800000 spikes to 2680 but closes 2514.72, 165.28 below that high and back inside the range, then 1789430400000 sells off to 2358.62 - a failed breakout / upthrust pattern and a 441-point round trip from the 2680 high.", "The last five bars (1789948800000-1790467199999) overlap inside 2633.31-2786.81 and none exceeds the 2850 high; the final close of 2694.96 is 155.04 below 2850, so the new-high breakout has no follow-through yet.", "1789948800000 closes 74.39 below its 2850 high and 1789776000000 leaves a 2786.81 upper wick, which is consistent with a buy-climax style push after three fast bull bars rather than a sustained channel."], "evidence_for": ["1787097600000 opens 1916.51 and closes 2252.16, clearing the 73-bar range top of 1974.46 by 277.70 on the close with only a 41.64 upper tail, followed by 1787270400000's 2771 high - a decisive bull breakout of the multi-month range rather than a single-bar probe.", "Swing lows after the spike rise or hold: 2111 (1787184000000), 2394.91 (1788134400000), 2357.18 (1788307200000) then 2358.62 (1789430400000) just 1.44 higher, and 2436.87 (1789689600000) - no lower low in the last 27 bars.", "1789689600000-1789948800000 closes 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61 hold above the 2357.18-2557.46 range, so the move above the post-spike range top has acceptance, not just wicks.", "The 2850 high of 1789948800000 exceeds the spike high of 2771 and the 2680 high of 1789084800000, keeping the swing sequence of higher highs and higher lows intact across the last 38 bars."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens 1780099200000 at 2013.41 and falls to a 1368.42 low at 1780704000000, whose close of 1568.55 is 200.13 above its low (wide bear legs with a large final lower tail).", "1780790400000-1787011200000 (73 bars) overlap inside a 1512.91 (1782432000000 low) to 1974.46 (1785110400000 high) range; lows rise from 1512.91 to 1868.51 while highs stall at 1944.39-1974.46.", "The last 13 bars of that range (1786060800000-1787011200000) are small overlapping bars clustering in 1868.51-1937.76 directly before the expansion.", "Bar 1787097600000 opens 1916.51, closes 2252.16, with a 2293.8 high: a 388.17-range bull bar closing 277.70 above the prior 1974.46 range top.", "1787270400000 extends to 2771, then 1787356800000-1788998400000 (20 bars) overlap between 2357.18 (1788307200000 low) and 2557.46 (1787788800000 high).", "Bar 1789084800000 spikes to 2680 but closes 2514.72, 165.28 below that high and back inside the 20-bar range; 1789430400000 then puts in a 2358.62 low, 1.44 above the 2357.18 low.", "1789689600000-1789948800000 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9 and 2775.61, clearing the 2557.46 range top and the 2771 spike high; the 1789948800000 high is 2850, 74.39 above its close.", "1789948800000-1790467199999 (last five bars) overlap inside 2633.31-2786.81; the final bar opens 2690.56, closes 2694.96 at 2695.17 high and 2665.14 low, still 155.04 below the 2850 high."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Sell climax / bear leg: five wide bear bars drive from 2030.49 down to 1368.42, ending with a large lower tail on 1780704000000 (close 1568.55).", "end_time_ms": 1780703999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780099200000, "upper_boundary": "2030.49"}, {"description": "Large overlapping trading range after the sell-off: 1512.91-1974.46 over 73 bars, with gradually rising lows and capped highs