(1789430400000) would leave 2850 as a lower-high failure after 2771 and shift primary_regime toward trading-range or transition-unclear.", "Continued bar-by-bar overlap inside 2633.31-2786.81 without a new high keeps the current phase as a range at the highs rather than a resumed spike."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "unclear", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790481599999, "directional_pressure": "balanced", "evidence_against": ["The higher-low sequence since the window low is unbroken: 2358.62, 2568.16, 2633.31, 2665.14, which is classic bull-trend structure.", "The bull leg carried strong trend energy (large bull bodies at bars 69-70, 2850 push) and the deep pullback held above the bar-80 low of 2568.16, so this range may be a bull flag rather than a top.", "Bars 119 and 120 closed at 2694.96 and 2695.79, at the top of the coil, and no bar has closed below the coil low of 2665.14.", "A 34-bar pause near the highs after a spike breakout is often a continuation structure, and the mtr-like lower high at 2740.42 has not been rejected by any bear breakout under 2633.31, so the range-versus-trend distinction is genuinely unresolved."], "evidence_for": ["The post-2850 range (34 bars) is as long as the preceding 29-bar bull leg, and the bars inside it overlap heavily instead of progressing.", "Highs have stepped down since the 2850 high (2804.59, 2786.81, 2740.42) and no close since then has exceeded 2775.61, so the prior uptrend has not extended.", "The 2638.49-2850 advance was fully retraced to 2633.31 (bar 104), removing the last bull leg's progress; price now sits below the 2700 area it broke near bars 74 and 84.", "The last ten bars are a ~56.6-point two-sided coil with overlapping bodies and falling volume (1.9M-3.9M), showing no directional follow-through; breakout mode is unresolved.", "Bars 99 (2727.77-2648.49) and 104 (2693.42-2633.31) show sellers still able to produce full-size bear bars inside the range."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["120 closed H4 bars, 1788753600000-1790481599999; first close 2487.55, last close 2695.79; window high 2850 (bar open_time 1789977600000) and window low 2358.62 (bar open_time 1789488000000).", "Bars 1-26 rotated with heavy overlap between roughly 2411.04 and 2520.68; bar 27 (open 2457.12) spiked to 2680 and closed 2555.52, leaving a ~124-point upper tail.", "Bars 38-52 declined from 2524.68 to 2358.62 (-6.6%), with consecutive bear bars 51-52 on the window's heaviest volume (9.26M, 10.21M).", "Bars 53-86 rallied from 2370.54 to 2850 (+20.2%); bars 69 (2507.15-2585.5) and 70 (2578.44-2643.52) are large bull bodies, and bar 86 (open 2658.81, high 2850, close 2723.15) closed ~127 points below its high.", "Since the 2850 high there are 34 bars with stepping-down highs: 2850, 2804.59 (bar 89), 2786.81 (bar 97), 2740.42 (bar 110); the highest close after the high is 2775.61 (bar 89).", "Pullback low 2633.31 (bar 104) fully retraces the 2638.49-2850 segment; higher swing lows since 2358.62 read 2568.16 (bar 80), 2633.31 (bar 104), 2665.14 (bar 119).", "Bars 111-120 form a 2665.14-2721.75 coil (~56.6 points, ~2.1%): small overlapping bars, falling volume (1.9M-3.9M vs 8-10M at the spikes), and bars 119-120 closing at 2694.96 and 2695.79 near the coil high; this is a coiled breakout-mode structure with unresolved direction."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "trading-range", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear swing leg: bar 43 high 2524.68 down to bar 52 low 2358.62; mostly overlapping lower closes ending in a two-bar sell spike (bars 51-52).", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789358400000, "upper_boundary": "2524.68"}, {"description": "Bull spike-and-channel leg: bars 58-86 advance from 2370.54 to 2850 with shallow pullbacks at bars 78-80; largest bull bodies at bars 69-70, with 2643.52 then 2700 taken out before the 2850 push.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2370.54", "start_time_ms": 1789574400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Single-bar buying climax candidate: bar 86 (open 2658.81, high 2850, low 2658.06, close 2723.15) printed the window high with a ~127-point upper tail after a 20% run; not confirmed by later bars.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Possible major-trend-reversal shape, unconfirmed: from the 2850 high price fell to 2633.31 (bar 104), breaking the bull trend line, then rallied to a lower high 2740.42 (bar 110); no break below 2633.31 has occurred, so no reversal is established.", "end_time_ms": 1790337599999, "kind": "mtr-like", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Broad trading range at the highs since bar 87: 34 bars of overlap between 2633.31 and 2850, with repeated failure and stalling in the 2690-2700 shelf that was broken in bars 68-74.", "end_time_ms": 1790481599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Tight ten-bar coil (bars 111-120) between 2665.14 and 2721.75: small bodies, doji-like overlapping bars, falling volume, closes clustered at 2683-2696; two-sided and in breakout mode rather than trending.", "end_time_ms": 1790481599999, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2665.14", "start_time_ms": 1790337600000, "upper_boundary": "2721.75"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["A close above 2740.42 (bar 110 high) followed by a bar holding above it would end the coil upward and move the read toward bull-trend continuation.", "A close below 2665.14 (bar 119 low) and then below 2633.31 (bar 104 low) would confirm the mtr-like lower high and move the read toward a bear leg or range breakdown.", "A wide-range breakout bar from 2665.14-2721.75 with immediate same-direction follow-through would end breakout mode and define the next leg.", "Continued small overlapping bars inside 2665.14-2721.75 would keep the range/breakout-mode read and the Always-In question unresolved.", "A quick return inside the coil after any poke outside its boundaries would keep the trading-range classification intact."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2724.95", "close_time_ms": 1790063999999, "high": "2732.47", "low": "2721.79", "open": "2729.59", "open_time_ms": 1790060400000, "volume": "1716566.034"}, {"close": "2748.73", "close_time_ms": 1790067599999, "high": "2748.84", "low": "2722.76", "open": "2724.95", "open_time_ms": 1790064000000, "volume": "1871678.083"}, {"close": "2749.09", "close_time_ms": 1790071199999, "high": "2752.61", "low": "2734.16", "open": "2748.83", "open_time_ms": 1790067600000, "volume": "2131476.579"}, {"close": "2742.58", "close_time_ms": 1790074799999, "high": "2749.88", "low": "2736", "open": "2749.08", "open_time_ms": 1790071200000, "volume": "1514891.513"}, {"close": "2740.2", "close_time_ms": 1790078399999, "high": "2745.79", "low": "2735.85", "open": "2742.59", "open_time_ms": 1790074800000, "volume": "2036543.825"}, {"close": "2755.14", "close_time_ms": 1790081999999, "high": "2755.14", "low": "2737.49", "open": "2740.2", "open_time_ms": 1790078400000, "volume": "1844011.946"}, {"close": "2758.3", "close_time_ms": 1790085599999, "high": "2761.62", "low": "2739.8", "open": "2755.14", "open_time_ms": 1790082000000, "volume": "2117384.501"}, {"close": "2741.23", "close_time_ms": 1790089199999, "high": "2758.3", "low": "2722.62", "open": "2758.06", "open_time_ms": 1790085600000, "volume": "2112781.771"}, {"close": "2742.31", "close_time_ms": 1790092799999, "high": "2753.91", "low": "2736.2", "open": "2741.23", "open_time_ms": 17900892